      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LATE 2014\nGraphite / Carbon /\nWhisper files\n\nNo replication —\none dead disk =\npermanent metric loss\n\nGrowing the cluster =\nmanual resharding\n\nFine at low scale.\nNot built for this.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LATE 2014\nGraphite / Carbon /\nWhisper files\n\nNo replication —\none dead disk =\npermanent metric loss\n\nGrowing the cluster =\nmanual resharding\n\nFine at low scale.\nNot built for this.",
