      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE 'OBVIOUS' FIX\nstatsite (aggregation)\n+ Cassandra, Date\nTiered Compaction\n+ ElasticSearch (index)\n\nAll proven at scale.\nStill the wrong shape\nfor this data.\n\nOps burden + cost grew\nfaster than features.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THE 'OBVIOUS' FIX\nstatsite (aggregation)\n+ Cassandra, Date\nTiered Compaction\n+ ElasticSearch (index)\n\nAll proven at scale.\nStill the wrong shape\nfor this data.\n\nOps burden + cost grew\nfaster than features.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
