      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE ACTUAL SHIFT: not \"single node to distributed\" — every stage above was already distributed.\nThe shift was per-series iteration to columnar Blocks: process a time window across many series in one pass, instead of looping over each series to answer one query.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THE ACTUAL SHIFT: not \"single node to distributed\" — every stage above was already distributed.\nThe shift was per-series iteration to columnar Blocks: process a time window across many series in one pass, instead of looping over each series to answer one query.",
